# Compiler output. Every file here is produced from a `.rgr` under
# gallery/evg by an npm script that compiles before it runs — `livebuild`,
# `livebuild:test`, `livebuild:agents`, `livebuild:serve` — so a fresh clone
# builds them and never needs them committed.
#
# Same rule as lib/evg/bin, gallery/ui/bin, gallery/vela/bin, gallery/book/bin
# and gallery/css/bin.
*
!.gitignore
